{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16002","headline":"镜听词 · 王建","name":"镜听词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重重摩挲嫁时镜，夫壻远行凭镜听。\n回身不遣别人知，人意丁宁镜神圣。\n怀中收拾双锦带，恐畏街头见惊怪。\n嗟嗟际际下堂阶，独自竈前来跪拜。\n出门愿不闻悲哀，郎在任郎回未回。\n月明地上人过尽，好语多同皆道来。\n卷帷上牀喜不定，与郎裁衣失翻正。\n可中三日得相见，重绣锦囊磨镜面。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"何丹尼"}